{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52536","headline":"其二 · 陈元光","name":"其二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"敦伦开野叟，勤学劝生儒。\n刊爵虽殊分，同仁本一途。\n云泥如有隔，水火岂相资。\n饮露知蝉洁，观颜觉监虚。\n潜光同隐豹，出宰必悬鱼。\n适国无先後，梯云有卷舒。\n天文回北极，水势赴东都。\n定策参耆宿，轮忠奉简书。\n弥重勳业懋，开国负称孤。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈元光","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52536.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52536","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}